# xtdl-flag-example: a FICTIONAL format, invented only for this example, on the
# `json` wire. It shows the `present` derive function (engine-spec 0.12): the
# flag `position_sent` is 1 when the entity carries a position, through the
# derive line in model/xtdl.def, and 0 by this pack's default when it carries
# none. Layout: pack.md.
format        xtdl-flag-example
version       0.1.0
distribution  controlled
source        "invented for this example; no external document"
wire          json
uses          xtdl

field    xtdl.position_sent  position_sent  int
default  xtdl.position_sent  0
field    lat                 lat            float
field    lon                 lon            float
field    speed_ms            speed_ms       float
